<title>UK: Telenor sets 150 mln Swiss franc Aug 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Telenor sets 150 mln Swiss franc Aug 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   TELENOR AS, NORWEGEN</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     2.75	MATURITY    24.AUG.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.150   PAY DATE    24.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.750     LISTING    EBS	 MOODY/S&amp;P   AA2/AA+</p>
<p> SALE LIMITS  US/UK/NORWAY</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
